WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:05.530
Meridian's community health promoters in Kilifi

2
00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:08.152
record their home visits in KoboToolbox.

3
00:00:08.152 --> 00:00:13.263
Helena wants those visits in ImpactMEL, where they can be checked and counted.

4
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:17.081
Integrations connects to KoboToolbox and DHIS2.

5
00:00:17.081 --> 00:00:22.476
Anything brought in arrives as a draft for review, never as a final figure.

6
00:00:22.893 --> 00:00:25.794
She adds a KoboToolbox connector, names it,

7
00:00:25.794 --> 00:00:29.236
and picks the Kilifi project its figures belong to.

8
00:00:31.129 --> 00:00:35.923
Then the Kobo server, and the API token from her Kobo account settings.

9
00:00:35.923 --> 00:00:40.311
The token is kept hidden here, and ImpactMEL stores it encrypted.

10
00:00:40.728 --> 00:00:43.699
She saves the connector, and tests the connection.

11
00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:49.174
The forms in her Kobo account are listed.

12
00:00:49.174 --> 00:00:50.849
She picks Household visits.

13
00:00:52.188 --> 00:00:55.415
She can also copy the form itself into ImpactMEL,

14
00:00:55.415 --> 00:00:58.576
so the questions live alongside her other forms.

15
00:00:59.008 --> 00:00:59.989
Now the mapping.

16
00:00:59.989 --> 00:01:02.930
The households reached question adds up into the

17
00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:06.669
indicator for household visits by community health promoters.

18
00:01:07.112 --> 00:01:10.923
The form also asks for the gender of the head of household.

19
00:01:10.923 --> 00:01:16.156
She uses that as the breakdown, so every figure arrives split by female and male.

20
00:01:16.585 --> 00:01:19.446
The visit date decides the reporting period,

21
00:01:19.446 --> 00:01:23.216
so October visits land in the October to December quarter.

22
00:01:23.648 --> 00:01:24.833
Everything is set.

23
00:01:24.833 --> 00:01:26.675
She imports the submissions.

24
00:01:27.091 --> 00:01:28.853
All seven visits were read.

25
00:01:28.853 --> 00:01:31.920
They came in before, so nothing is added twice.

26
00:01:33.897 --> 00:01:36.765
In Review, the figures are waiting as drafts.

27
00:01:36.765 --> 00:01:39.315
Nothing counts toward the indicator yet.

28
00:01:39.718 --> 00:01:45.126
Here is the household visits figure for Kilifi, for the October to December quarter,

29
00:01:45.126 --> 00:01:46.478
brought in from Kobo.

30
00:01:46.899 --> 00:01:50.744
From here it follows the same path as any other figure: sent,

31
00:01:50.744 --> 00:01:55.156
checked against its evidence, and approved before it reaches a report.
